# Trust: Semih (hidden quest TrustSemih): a level 99 Warrior in Heaven's Tower. Kupipi (her script npcs/Kupipi.lua; no
# default; the other quests that answer her: Trust: Windurst, Portal Charm, missions). RoV The Path Untraveled completed
# (setup). No permit: the check fails: her script. The Windurst Trust Permit (a GM): every talk gives the cipher (the
# stopgap) and plays noAction; with a full inventory the giveItem fails (its message, no cipher). The cipher held: the
# check fails: her script. Kupipi+1 is the Kupipi a client sees (the first is cutscene_only).
lists HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0,30.9 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Rov ThePathUntraveled completed
login
trigger Kupipi+1                          # no permit: the check fails: her script / other quests
finish-if-event
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Kupipi+1                          # no room: giveItem fails; noAction
free-inventory
trigger Kupipi+1                          # the cipher; noAction
trigger Kupipi+1                          # the cipher held: the check fails
finish-if-event
